💡 Quick Tips for Beginners
Don't Cluster: A single AI torpedo spread can hit multiple ships if they are grouped too tightly.

Save Ammo: Don't fire at targets at max range unless you absolutely have to. You only have a limited supply.

Watch the CD: Keep track of your Ability Cooldowns. Don't waste a Sonar Ping if the weather is already CLEAR.
